    {
      "id": "step-4",
      "number": 4,
      "heading": "Start the slow cooker",
      "blocks": [
        "Add the onion, ginger and garlic paste, {{flour}} flour and pepper to the beef and cook for 1 minute. Add black bean paste, soy sauce, rice wine and {{sauce-water}} boiled water. Bring to a boil, transfer to the slow cooker, stir, cover and cook on high for 2 hours."
      ],
      "notes": [],
